TEXT -776 384 Left 2 ;Transient disabled for AC sweep
TEXT 344 -96 Left 2 ;VHIGH bulk bank: 12 x 22uF/160V represented by equivalent R-L-C
TEXT 344 -64 Left 2 ;Common HF bank: (470n || 470n) series (470n || 470n)
TEXT 728 -8 Left 2 ;Buck input filter #1
TEXT 1888 -8 Left 2 ;Buck input filter #2
TEXT -768 536 Left 2 ;Notes:
TEXT -768 560 Left 2 ;Cbulk = 12 x 22uF in parallel. ESR/ESL are equivalent values for the bank.
TEXT -768 584 Left 2 ;HF bank = two 470nF in parallel on each side of the series midpoint.
TEXT -768 608 Left 2 ;Local CIN = two 4.7uF in parallel on each side of the series midpoint.
TEXT -768 632 Left 2 ;KBIAS scales the local 4.7uF MLCC capacitance for DC-bias derating.
TEXT -768 656 Left 2 ;Plot V(VHIGH), V(VIN1), V(VIN2), I(L1), I(L2).
TEXT -768 680 Left 2 ;For worst-case bus sweep, add: .step param VBUS list 12 24 48 110
TEXT 80 864 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 100 100Meg
